{"id":"partes","lemma":"partes","pos":"noun","rank":639,"glosses":["genitalia"],"ipa":"/ˈpaɾtes/","gender":"f","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-GlyphEnjoyer-partes.wav","examples":[{"text":"Había sangre por todas partes.","en":"There was blood everywhere.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/75845"},{"text":"Encontramos problemas por todas partes.","en":"We found trouble everywhere.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/333145"},{"text":"Los policías están por todas partes.","en":"Cops are everywhere.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448272"},{"text":"Mi cámara me acompaña a todas partes.","en":"My camera goes wherever I go.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/819816"},{"text":"Este libro está dividido en cuatro partes.","en":"This book is divided into four parts.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589762"}]}